4],["ἐπὶ",705080,0],["τὸ",709436,24],["ὄρος",709768,25],["τὸ",709436,24],["ἅγιον",700159,27],["ἐν",704639,0],["Ιερουσαλημ",706644,1]],"And it shall come to pass in that day, [that] they shall blow the great trumpet, and the lost ones in the land of the Assyrians shall come, and the lost ones in Egypt, and shall worship the Lord on the holy mountain in Jerusalem."]]